### 5.1 φ‑Structured Decay Constant and Instanton Action

The QCD axion is normally characterized by a decay constant $$f_a$$ and mass $$m_a$$ related via QCD dynamics.[8][9][10] ESQET‑UIFT imposes φ‑structure on these parameters.

**Assumption A1 (φ‑scaled PQ scale).**  
