$$

These are explicit ansätze, not results of a derived UV completion in QCD‑like dynamics.

### 5.2 Axion Mass Ansätze

In standard QCD axion theory, the mass approximately follows $$m_a \sim \Lambda_{\text{QCD}}^2/f_a$$.[8][9][10] ESQET‑UIFT instead proposes a φ‑structured form:

